# systemd-sysusers: privilege-separation user for qp-sshd (OpenSSH privsep).
#
# Stock hosts with openssh-server already have 'sshd'; sysusers is idempotent
# (no-op if present). Shipping it lets qp-ssh work on minimal hosts and makes
# rpm's generator emit Provides: user(sshd)/group(sshd) for any auto-Requires.
#
#Type Name  ID  GECOS                       Home dir    Shell
u    sshd  -   "Privilege-separated SSH"   /var/empty  /usr/sbin/nologin
